<title>UK: UK'S Wickes pulls out of S. Africa venture.</title>
<headline>UK'S Wickes pulls out of S. Africa venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British do-it-yourself retailer Wickes Plc said on Monday it would withdraw from its Wickes South Africa Ltd joint venture with Federated Blaikie Ltd.</p>
</text>
